<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dong-Ah head not yet decided on appeal.</title>
<headline>Dong-Ah head not yet decided on appeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choi Won-suk, chairman of Dong-Ah Group, has not yet decided whether to appeal the 2-1/2 year jail sentence handed to him on Monday for bribing former president Roh Tae-woo, a group spokesman said.  </p>
<p>&quot;We are all shocked after the chairman got a jail sentence. We had expected a suspended jail sentence for him at most,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>State prosecutors had demanded Choi be sentenced to four years in jail.</p>
</text>
